          <TD STYLE="text-align: left">When shares are offered to the public on a &#147;best efforts&#148; basis, the brokers participating in the offering are only required to use their best efforts to sell the shares and have no firm commitment or obligation to purchase any of the shares. Therefore, we may not sell all of the shares that we are offering. </TD>

